# Fetched or rebuilt
# The corpora are other people's, licensed by their authors, and download.py
# fetches them so that each reader takes them from source rather than from a
# copy here. drafts.csv is rebuilt from them on every run and reproduces
# eighteen hundred source prompts verbatim. benchmark.csv, prompts.csv and
# sources.md sit outside this directory and are committed, because they are the
# benchmark and the record of where it came from.
archive/
archive temp/
data/process/

# Collected replies
# Raw provider files and the replies read out of them. Large, and regenerated
# by rerunning the pass rather than by rebuilding, so losing them costs money
# rather than a command. Keep a copy somewhere that is not this repository.
data/batches/
results/**/*.jsonl

